<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CEZ posts CZK H1 3.53 bln net- IAS.</title>
<headline>Czech CEZ posts CZK H1 3.53 bln net- IAS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech power utility CEZ a.s. said on Friday  that it posted 3.53 billion crowns after tax profit in the first half  of 1997, to international accounting standards, versus 5.95 billion  in the same period last year.  </p>
<p>Results for six month period ending June 30, 1997, to international  accounting standards (in billions of crowns).</p>
<p>				    H1 1997	     H1 1996</p>
<p> AFTER TAX PROFIT	     3.53		   5.95</p>
<p> PRE-TAX PROFIT		 5.93		   9.61</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT	     7.53		   9.72</p>
<p> OPERATING REVENUES	  28.17		  28.51</p>
<p> OPERATING EXPENSES	  20.64		  18.79</p>
<p> ASSETS			 164.64		 149.62</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
